c(10, "§0.5; §0.5 table (verbatim); §3.9; §8.2; §8.3", "must-never-break", "Problems are few, specific and fixable — U:negative_any 7 (8.14%, CI 4.0–15.9%), every review below five stars contains one (verbatim): " + table("## 0.5 Problems are few", 0) + " — date logic is the only defect reported twice (DEF_DATE_LOGIC 2: a weekend tick fills both days; a widget counter increments the following day, 'possibly a time zone mismatch'); one launch failure after 7 days (3★); a yearly percentage counted from the habit's start rather than the year; icons in transparency mode; one widget per habit only; two ask for something the listing says exists (MISUNDERSTAND_EXISTING 2: data cannot survive a phone change vs 'IMPORT AND EXPORT… restore it at any time'; widgets) — 'discoverability problems, not missing features'.", "few defects; date boundary; export undiscovered", "complaint", "negative_any 7 / 8.14%; DEF_DATE_LOGIC 2; DEF_WIDGET 1; DEF_WONT_OPEN 1; RISK_DATA_LOSS 1; DEF_STATS_CALC 1; MISUNDERSTAND_EXISTING 2", "must-never-break", "High-priority", "generalisable", ["12782107949", "13318616929", "13682367544", "13761082816", "13852112119", "13985196266", "14499109087", "13426911405"], "", "")

